function about(){modal('About this build',`<div class="about-copy"><h3>STRATO Odds · local product prototype</h3><p>This build uses public STRATO Odds, Polymarket and Kalshi market data. News comes from the linked RSS publishers. All trading, balances, social profiles, leaderboards, discussions, maker programs and rewards are test fixtures or local simulations. They are not production STRATO statistics.</p><p>Concept questions use illustrative probabilities and histories. Connected public markets use genuine quotes, WebSocket updates where available, and REST fallback polling. The status indicator and last-update time show whether a feed is connected. The separate USD asset-price strip uses Coinbase Exchange public spot ticks and minute candles; it is context, not the resolution oracle or the prediction probability.</p><p>Posts stay in this browser. No external post is sent unless a publishing account is configured and you explicitly select that destination. X drafts and social cards work without a connected account.</p><p>Liquidity rewards use a transparent model budget, balanced quote assumptions and time in market. No return is guaranteed, and the displayed programs are design proposals.</p><p>Market catalog fetched: ${E(meta.fetchedAt||'snapshot')}. ${meta.status==='live'?'Public feeds connected.':'Showing a saved market snapshot.'}</p></div>${B('close','Close','button secondary full')}`,true);}
